#X text 250 20 GENDY drone (Xenakis' stochastic synthesis \, gently): a wave of 12 breakpoints read at the drone's pitch \; every 30 ms each breakpoint takes a small random step (mirrored at the edges) \, so the timbre keeps breathing while the pitch holds. Its own random numbers (not the piece's). The right side reads the same wave a hair sharp.;
